  "description": "VARSEQ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C81 H80 Dy6 N12 O31. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3A (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4? (Dy) has 0 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 8 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.853-4.473 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.64-124.40°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C81H80Dy6N12O31.",
